# Design Standards

## Diagram Format
- Format: .drawio exclusivement
- Storage: "diagrams/" directory
- Base template: structure_reseau_geographic.drawio
- XML: use native < and > (no HTML entities)

## Color Standards
- Network/DNS Services: 
  * Fill: medium blue (#b1c9f8)
  * Border: #4a67a9
- AD DS/Controllers: 
  * Fill: medium gray (#d9d9d9)
  * Border: #404040
- OU/Structure: 
  * Fill: medium orange (#ffc785)
  * Border: #bf7b00
- Actions/Flow: 
  * Fill: medium yellow (#ffe566)
  * Border: #b39200

## Visual Elements
- Connections:
  * Style: curved
  * Color: #666666
  * Opacity: 65%
  * Arrow size: 10px
- Containers:
  * Auto-size to content
  * Minimum padding: 10px
  * Rounded corners: 5px
- Text:
  * Font: Helvetica
  * Size: 11pt (default)
  * Bold for headers

## File Management
- Naming: snake_case in French
- Location: diagrams/[category]/
- Categories:
  * network/
  * structure/
  * process/

## Image Generation
- Never generate images directly
- Use ./convert_diagrams.sh for PNG
- PNG output goes to diagrams/png/
